THE PLAN

Model baseball games as accurately as possible to make better bets on baseball games.

BASIC IDEAS
- pitching is more important thing to get right than hitting because it is more consistent (so you gain more by focusing on it ... the average game has ~3 pitchers per side and 9 hitters per side)
- starting pitchers are the most important thing to get right because they are the constant for ~2/3 of the game (assuming the starter goes around 6 innings)

